  "$comment": "Published text and effect styles of the Pushpin Thumbprint UI Kit. These are the intended API for type and elevation in Figma, because the font-size and shadow variables are hidden from publishing. Pass a key to figma.importStyleByKeyAsync(), then node.setTextStyleIdAsync(style.id) or node.setEffectStyleIdAsync(style.id).",
