  "$note": "Text style line heights are stored as percentages in Figma, so the pixel values in tokens.figma.json are the resolved equivalents rather than a second source. Note also that the style weights use named font styles (Medium, Bold, Regular) while the token layer expresses weight numerically (563, 590, 660) — the styles are what actually renders.",

